    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "resources don't change the fact that the world is just built to crush people like me. i thought being a good person actually meant something, but it just made me a target. now i'm just an outcast with a ruined career and no one. it feels like there's no path back... like the version of my life that mattered is just gone forever.",
