    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want a \"quiet place\" to think about how much i failed. i just look at my life and see a complete void. everything that made me \"me\" is gone. there's no \"rebuilding\" when the foundation itself was a lie. do you think it's even possible to find meaning in a life that has been so completely stripped away? it feels more like a punishment than a mistake.",
